<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>
  Someone asked to reset the password for your RailsApp account. To choose a new password, visit
  <%= link_to "this password reset page", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>.
</p>

<p>This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.</p>

<p>If you didn’t ask for this, you can safely ignore this email; your password won’t change.</p>
